<box.text>
Hello everyone!
Dev here, this will be a long wall of text, so have have index here:
```
1. Feedback Survey Result
1.1. Feedback Q&A 
2. Changes I made
3. New Faction !new!
```
--separator--
<fat2>
# (1.) Feedback Survey Result:
<fat1>
The October feedback form process was effectively a failure. **Only one** person responded, but their honest answers were valuable and gaved me space to make preparations and plan for the near future.
_**Whoever you are, thank you very much.**_
<fat1>
Based on the message received, here are the responses and Q&A:
--separator--
# (1.1.) Feedback Q&A:
```diff
Q: The ability to see card abilities without having to add/remove them from the deck.
A: You say, and you have; I will add an button to start a carousel with cards something like in Witcher 3 ui to see all card you have in your deck

Q: Always the same soundtrack?
A: The soundtrack changes in a 24-hour rotation, each day, different one or at least it should be, during moon event also "waiting" music will be more _spooky_
A': Please note that custom server have at botton of json keys for "tavern & match ost", correct value is youtube video id, any video id, do with this information what you want
A'': Talking about custom server, after most of Gwent updates custom server gets updated too!

Q: Starter deck
A: Yeah, they are bit buggy and randomly generated each time you load game, becuause i had few issues wich them while adding and fixing cards (also I see now that few of them have empty config array, i will fill it now)

Q: Leader cards?
A: We have all leader cards from Witcher 3 and also few custom ones, you can change leader by clicking leader card in middle of deck maker
A': I am now planning to add a flashing icon next to the leader change element to attract users' attention

Q: -BUG-
A: Harvest festival card should not be resurrectable, thanks for bug report, i guess game still thinks they units

Q: New Faction?
A: It would be a nice challange, maybe, I could use some help wich it for idea, but why not if I can

Q: New cards?
A: I am always willing to add a new card if I come up with an idea or if the suggestion is valuable enought, right now a new card will be added automatically the following month, as its arrival has already been scheduled
```
<fat3>
<fat1>
--separator--
# (2.) Changes I made:
After reciving feedback, checking logs and etc, following changes were issued:
-# (Content of patchnotes)
<fat1>
### _16 October, 2026_
_Taking into account the feedback I received, as well as an analysis of the server logs and the design of the user interface, the result is the following update:_
```diff
--- _Added an animated settings wheel over the deck maker change leader element!_
    _I hope now everyone will see how to change your leader and discover more before hidden cards!_
    _I will keep an eye on whether any other changes to the interface might be needed!_
```
### _15 October, 2026 - Feedback Patch_
_Based on feedback I recive this changes were issued:_
```diff
+ _An message was issued, answering questions anonymously_
--- _Medic & Necromancers no longer are able to revive diversion cards, unless something is broken again_
    _(This cards have an uniqe row id, that is also just placeholder that crashed game becuase its not real row)_
--- _Expanded the card configuration array for the deck generator_
+ _Added 2 new deck maker button to see current cards !new!_
& _Calling all Witchers to Kear Mohren!_
```
<fat3>
# (3.) New Faction !new!
--separator--
## **Work on a new faction has begun!**
Please welcome the **_Witchers Forces_**!
<fat1>
%%img src="img/icons/deck_shield_witchersforces.png" style="max-width:45%"%%
-# 
%%img src="img/icons/deck_back_witchersforces.jpg" style="max-width:15%"%%
<fat1>
Witcher faction forcess will work around _Witcher Unity_, each Witcher on board will raise strenght of _Witcher School_ on board!
On top of that, for each lost or draw round Witcher faction pasive ability will trigger, allowing Witcher to draw a card!
Work is still in progress so things can change!
<fat1>
Thank you for your attention!
-##_ <color=#BBBCC1>Remember to join our Gwent [Discord Server](api/discord-iframe/page) to give me more feedback!</color>
</box.text>


